{'symbol': 'ON', 'date': '2023-05-09 14:43:00', 'title': 'NEW ONSEMI HYPERLUX IMAGE SENSOR FAMILY LEADS THE WAY IN NEXT-GENERATION ADAS TO MAKE CARS SAFER', 'text': 'SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ONSEMI (NASDAQ: ON), A LEADER IN INTELLIGENT POWER AND SENSING TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS HYPERLUX™ AUTOMOTIVE IMAGE SENSOR FAMILY. WITH A 2.1 ΜM PIXEL SIZE, INDUSTRY-LEADING 150DB ULTRA HIGH DYNAMIC RANGE (HDR) AND LED FLICKER MITIGATION (LFM) ACROSS THE FULL AUTOMOTIVE TEMPERATURE RANGE, THE HYPERLUX FAMILY PROVIDES HIGH PERFORMANCE, SPEED AND ADVANCED FEATURES TO PROPEL THE NEXT GENERATION OF ADVANCED DRIVER ASSISTANCE SYSTEMS (ADAS) F.'}